{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against an ever-growing tide of people needing to get to the elevator, going for max score in short 10 minute rounds! Overcrowding is inevitable, but it's the combos that you make on the way that count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple pixel art game was ranked #1 in <strong>fun</strong> in Ludum Dare 34 game jam in 2015. Since then it has been biding its time, finally ready to be unleashed on the world in its new greatly expanded form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944620/extras/e1cf9d4828fd6fc51f52c3d5be61571c.avif?t=1759510465\" width=762 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode with 50 different floors to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 different customers, many with unique twists on the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer: 2 player co-op and versus modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad walking animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944620/extras/fdaed22a12efd643deb28ea301495f21.apng?t=1759510465\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944620/extras/fdaed22a12efd643deb28ea301495f21.poster.avif?t=1759510465\" class=\"bb_img\" width=873 height=84 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Examples of customers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat lady that collects cats, greatly increasing max combo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxer that punches everyone 